#: ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:3
msgid "RESTful Resource Handling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:9
msgid ""
"Representational State Transfer (REST) is an architectural style for "
"distributed applications, first described by Roy Fielding in his 2000 PhD"
" dissertation, `Architectural Styles and the Design of Network-based "
"Software Architectures "
"<https://www.ics.uci.edu/~fielding/pubs/dissertation/top.htm>`_. That "
"might be a bit of a dry read, and you might find Martin Fowler's "
"`Richardson Maturity Model "
"<https://martinfowler.com/articles/richardsonMaturityModel.html>`_ a "
"gentler introduction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:18
msgid ""
"REST has been interpreted, and mis-interpreted, in more ways than most "
"software architectures, and it might be easier to say that the more of "
"Roy Fielding's principles that you embrace in an architecture, the most "
"\"RESTful\" your application would be considered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:23
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter makes it easy to create RESTful APIs for your resources, with"
" its resource routes and `ResourceController`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:28
msgid "Resource Routes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:30
msgid ""
"You can quickly create a handful of RESTful routes for a single resource "
"with the ``resource()`` method. This creates the five most common routes "
"needed for full CRUD of a resource: create a new resource, update an "
"existing one, list all of that resource, show a single resource, and "
"delete a single resource. The first parameter is the resource name:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:37 ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:114
msgid ""
"The ordering above is for clarity, whereas the actual order the routes "
"are created in, in RouteCollection, ensures proper route resolution"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:39
msgid ""
"The routes are matched in the order they are specified, so if you have a "
"resource photos above a get 'photos/poll' the show action's route for the"
" resource line will be matched before the get line. To fix this, move the"
" get line above the resource line so that it is matched first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/restful.rst:41
msgid ""
"The second parameter accepts an array of options that can be used to "
"modify the routes that are generated. While these routes are geared "
"toward API-usage, where more methods are allowed, you can pass in the "
"``websafe`` option to have it generate update and delete methods that "
"work with HTML forms:"
msgstr ""

